# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a short jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim). For the first time stepping through a portal (game/travel.js; the portal sounds now).
# Not played by the game yet: only in tools/player.html, under Jingles.
title    Portal
composer Claude
about    Through the glass for the first time: a crystal swirl up and back down, a glass harmonica chord swelling in, wind chimes, and the bird's wide call on the other side.
tempo    90
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.6

# mood explore: bird sweep harm chimes

voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.35 rev=0.8
voice sweep    crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.3 rev=0.7
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.24 pan=0    center=A4 att=0.4 rel=1.2
voice chimes   chimes     vol=0.36 pan=-0.35

pattern through
sweep   | E5 A5 B5 E6 A6 B6 E7 B6 A6 E6 B5 A5 | _ |
harm    | [Aadd9]?----------- | % |
chimes  | x..... ...... | _ |
bird    | _ | E6 A5+B5---------- |

loop through
